{"file": {"name": "main.gti", "text": "import std.source_location;\nimport std.string;\n#macro check_value(int value, std::source_location loc) {\n  std::string hidden = loc.file;\n}\nint main() {\n  check_value!(1, std::source_location::current());\n  return 0;\n}\n"}}
